===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|messer|lang=gmh}}, {{term|mezzer|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|mezzeres|lang=goh}}, {{term|mezzirahs|lang=goh}}, {{term|mezzisahs||knife|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*matisahsą||knife}}, from {{m|gem-pro|*matiz||food}} + {{m|gem-pro|*sahsą||knife, dagger}}. Cognate with {{etyl|osx|-}} {{term|metisahs|lang=osx}}, {{term|mezas||knife|lang=osx}}, {{etyl|fy|-}} {{term|mês|lang=fy}}, {{etyl|nl|-}} {{term|mes||knife|lang=nl}}, {{etyl|ang|-}} {{term|meteseax||knife|lang=ang}}. See also {{l|en|meat}}, {{l|en|sax}}.

